 "title": "Hidden copies: mod-3 influence in principle, not in practice",
 "subject": "Whether gadgets of stitched harmony copies with hidden copies give an additive relation on the copies they show",
 "conclusion": "Gadgets of stitched harmony copies never give flip-blind parity, and no small one gives an additive readout (exact); by known theorems, harmonies with three symmetric classes admit a mod-3 one of impractical size.",
